      "quote": "The state requirement to allow two homes per single-family lot, and the bar on requiring a public hearing for such projects, are repealed.",
      "mechanism": "Removes the state mandate that streamlines approval for two homes per lot, permitting cities to mandate hearings and restrict lots to single homes.",
      "certainty": "stated"
    },
